{"4554690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Core Reaper", "steam_appid": 4554690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you survive?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Reaper is an intense top-down roguelite shooter. Steer your spaceship directly with your mouse through massive enemy hordes. Combine unique upgrades, tear through enemy waves, craft the ultimate build. Will you survive the onslaught till the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/1e91fa8b9f9b9fca92f4710e5c661362.poster.avif?t=1782218344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/1e91fa8b9f9b9fca92f4710e5c661362.webm?t=1782218344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/1e91fa8b9f9b9fca92f4710e5c661362.mp4?t=1782218344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and become unstoppable</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reap through enemies and collect their cores to upgrade your systems. Every upgrade is randomized with different rarities, making every single run unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/80d9fffb56446907cfb51ce83758d97a.poster.avif?t=1782218344\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/80d9fffb56446907cfb51ce83758d97a.webm?t=1782218344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/80d9fffb56446907cfb51ce83758d97a.mp4?t=1782218344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Characters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique characters to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ upgrades and synergies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/0e08f7fefe51bbae93e4ace60db3cdb8.poster.avif?t=1782218344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/0e08f7fefe51bbae93e4ace60db3cdb8.webm?t=1782218344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/0e08f7fefe51bbae93e4ace60db3cdb8.mp4?t=1782218344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you survive?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Reaper is an intense top-down roguelite shooter. Steer your spaceship directly with your mouse through massive enemy hordes. Combine unique upgrades, tear through enemy waves, craft the ultimate build. Will you survive the onslaught till the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/1e91fa8b9f9b9fca92f4710e5c661362.poster.avif?t=1782218344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/1e91fa8b9f9b9fca92f4710e5c661362.webm?t=1782218344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554690/extras/1e91fa8b9f9b9fca92f4710e5c66136